## Published JavaScript and TypeScript surfaces

`@tynd/cli` publishes a thin native launcher and a dependency-free typed config
surface. `@tynd/mcp` publishes a thin native launcher and its static catalog.
`@tynd/core` remains the TypeScript application API.

Direct runtime dependencies of the published `@tynd/core` surface:

- c12              (MIT)              — https://github.com/unjs/c12
- devalue          (MIT)              — https://github.com/Rich-Harris/devalue
- pathe            (MIT)              — https://github.com/unjs/pathe
- valibot          (MIT)              — https://github.com/open-circle/valibot

## Application runtime

Applications packaged by `tynd build` contain the selected Bun runtime:

- Bun              (MIT)              — https://github.com/oven-sh/bun

## Tynd native plugins

Native plugins are Rust crates linked into an application-specific host.
JavaScript plugins run with the application's Bun backend. Official plugins
live under https://github.com/kvnpetit/tynd/tree/main/plugins/standalone.
